# Land and return

When the user asks to open a PR, land the work, or declare the branch complete: wait for green CI, confirm the CI merge gate, land (prefer squash), then check out up-to-date `main` and delete the feature branch. Do not stay parked on a merged branch; do not force-push `main`; do not land drafts/WIP.

**Authority:** [`CONTRIBUTING.md`](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) (land and return, CI merge gate, feature-branch policy).
